{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your mark... Go! Create up to 5 characters, upgrade your swimmer, recruit swimmers to improve your team and climb to the top division. Build your team from scratch and compete for the championship! Start your dynasty now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize up to 5 characters, one for each type of stroke: Backstroke, Breaststroke, Butterfly, Freestyle, and All Around. Upgrade them to their max potential to dominate the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a57511dd1153f33c13ebbcf2138623fc.poster.avif?t=1769899255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a57511dd1153f33c13ebbcf2138623fc.webm?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a57511dd1153f33c13ebbcf2138623fc.mp4?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Swimmers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recruitment points to message swimmers and convince them to join your team. The higher division you are in the easier it will be to recruit higher caliber swimmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a98f4fcdedb5faac810b8bec295c5956.poster.avif?t=1769899255\" width=1170 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a98f4fcdedb5faac810b8bec295c5956.webm?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a98f4fcdedb5faac810b8bec295c5956.mp4?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Roster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which events you want each swimmer to compete in to have the best chance of winning each meet. Choose which swimmers to cut when new recruits are added.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/3bd4067ab211b365adabbb37d0a09f81.poster.avif?t=1769899255\" width=1080 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/3bd4067ab211b365adabbb37d0a09f81.webm?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/3bd4067ab211b365adabbb37d0a09f81.mp4?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474660?t=1769899255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474660?t=1769899255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/887f9a6d62797668f502a43a9aa6c903e0a7dc31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769899255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/887f9a6d62797668f502a43a9aa6c903e0a7dc31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769899255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4356160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your mark... Go! Create up to 5 characters, upgrade your swimmer, recruit swimmers to improve your team and climb to the top division. Build your team from scratch and compete for the championship! Start your dynasty now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize up to 5 characters, one for each type of stroke: Backstroke, Breaststroke, Butterfly, Freestyle, and All Around. Upgrade them to their max potential to dominate the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a57511dd1153f33c13ebbcf2138623fc.poster.avif?t=1769899255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a57511dd1153f33c13ebbcf2138623fc.webm?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a57511dd1153f33c13ebbcf2138623fc.mp4?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Swimmers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recruitment points to message swimmers and convince them to join your team. The higher division you are in the easier it will be to recruit higher caliber swimmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a98f4fcdedb5faac810b8bec295c5956.poster.avif?t=1769899255\" width=1170 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a98f4fcdedb5faac810b8bec295c5956.webm?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/a98f4fcdedb5faac810b8bec295c5956.mp4?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Roster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which events you want each swimmer to compete in to have the best chance of winning each meet. Choose which swimmers to cut when new recruits are added.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/3bd4067ab211b365adabbb37d0a09f81.poster.avif?t=1769899255\" width=1080 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/3bd4067ab211b365adabbb37d0a09f81.webm?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/extras/3bd4067ab211b365adabbb37d0a09f81.mp4?t=1769899255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","developers":["Gray Hair Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474660/1059ae1bfb7163073b3c74c024542d50c42db66b/header.jpg?t=1769899255","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.9Ghz Dual-Core Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 1536MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2474660/1383051630/69b9d9c8e71ff9dfb98e30c5915e6875bdd8be8c/1768757914/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768758419","dash_h264":"https://video.a